---
title: Course collection
layout: home
description: Every course — a tall card on a pattern, with a drawn diagram of the idea instead of a photograph, the level, the length and the price.
eyebrow: Collections · Course
source: src/components/coursenav.css
---
<section class="im-section im-wrap" style="padding-top: 1.5rem; --im-section-gap: 1.5rem">
	<p class="im-eyebrow">Collections · Course · {{page.title}}</p>
	<p class="im-lede">{{page.description}}</p>
	<p class="doc-source"><code>{{page.source}}</code></p>
</section>

<div class="im-wrap-wide im-stack" style="--im-stack-gap: 2rem">
	<header class="im-collhead im-collhead-patterned">
		<span class="im-collhead-art im-bg-blueprint" style="--im-art: var(--im-c-course)" aria-hidden="true"></span>
		<p class="im-eyebrow">Courses</p>
		<h1 class="im-collhead-title">Things I teach</h1>
		<p class="im-collhead-text">Filmed and written, one idea each, with every source file. Two lessons of every course are free.</p>
		<p class="im-collhead-meta"><span>{{demo.courses.length}} courses</span><span>2,100 students</span><span>4.8 average</span></p>
	</header>

	<div class="im-collbar">
		<div class="im-collbar-filters" role="group" aria-label="Level" data-im-filter="#courses">
			<button class="im-tag" type="button" value="all" aria-current="page">All</button>
			<button class="im-tag" type="button" value="beginner" aria-current="false">Beginner</button>
			<button class="im-tag" type="button" value="intermediate" aria-current="false">Intermediate</button>
			<button class="im-tag" type="button" value="advanced" aria-current="false">Advanced</button>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="im-coursecards" id="courses">
		{{#each demo.courses}}
		<article class="im-coursecard {{pattern}}" data-facet="{{level}}" style="--im-pattern-color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--im-c-course) 30%, transparent)">
			<div class="im-coursecard-art" aria-hidden="true">{{{diagram}}}</div>
			<div class="im-coursecard-body">
				<p class="im-coursecard-meta"><span class="im-kind" data-kind="course">{{icon "graduation-cap"}}{{level}}</span><span>{{lessons}} lessons</span><span>{{time}}</span></p>
				<h2 class="im-coursecard-title"><a href="/collections/course/page/">{{name}}</a></h2>
				<p class="im-coursecard-text">{{text}}</p>
				<p class="im-coursecard-foot"><span class="im-rating" style="--im-rating: {{rating}}"><span class="im-rating-stars" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="im-rating-value">{{rating}}</span></span><b>{{cost}}</b></p>
			</div>
		</article>
		{{/each}}
		<p class="im-feed-empty" data-facet-empty hidden>Nothing at that level yet.</p>
	</div>
</div>

<section class="im-section im-wrap"><div class="im-prose">
<p><code>im-coursecard</code>: tall, on a pattern in the collection's colour, with a drawn diagram of the idea in the upper half — a course is an idea, not a place, so there is no photograph. Level, lessons, length, the score and the price. The diagram animates on hover, not on load.</p>
</div></section>
